{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/congregation","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"קהל"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" נַעֲלֶה שׁוֹפָר עִם תַּחֲנוּן. שַׁדַּי לְפַתּוֹתְךָ בָּם בְּחִנּוּן. "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"חזן"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" תָּשִׁיב "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"musaf_uppad_lindan_variant"}}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{}}
{"text":"לִנְדָן"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{}}
{"text":"לַנֶּֽדֶן"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" בְּרַק הַשָּׁנוּן. תַּחֲזֵק מָגֵן לְגוֹנְנֵי בְּגִנּוּן: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
